# Flyback demo reel: 16 s at 60 fps, the five machines in turn.
#     hvtest --film 960 --size 1280x720 --script docs/demo.cues \
#       | ffmpeg -f rawvideo -pix_fmt rgba -s 1280x720 -r 60 -i - -pix_fmt yuv420p demo.mp4
#
# Tracks are held before their first key and interpolated BETWEEN keys, so a
# dropdown changes on a pair of keys a frame apart (`179 Preset 1 / 180
# Preset 2`), and a button press is three keys (`29 Fire 0 / 30 Fire 1 /
# 31 Fire 0`) -- without the key before, the value would ramp and cross 0.5
# halfway there.

# 0-3 s: the Tesla coil, the interrupter sweeping up from 30 to 400 BPS: the
# streamers lengthen as the channel stays hot between bangs.
0    Preset    1
0    BPS       0.3
90   BPS       0.3
170  BPS       0.85
179  Preset    1

# 3-6 s: the Jacob's ladder, climbing, bowing, snapping at L*, restriking.
180  Preset    2
359  Preset    2

# 6-9 s: the Van de Graaff, polished: no corona, a spark every C V_b / I. Fired once
# more by hand at 7.5 s.
360  Preset    3
449  Fire      0
450  Fire      1
451  Fire      0
539  Preset    3

# 9-12.5 s: the plasma globe; a finger on the glass at 10.5 s pulls the
# filaments together.
540  Preset    4
540  Finger    0
629  Finger    0
630  Finger    1
540  Finger X  0.62
540  Finger Y  0.78
749  Preset    4

# 12.5-16 s: a Lichtenberg figure growing, and a fresh one at 14.5 s.
750  Preset    5
869  Fire      0
870  Fire      1
871  Fire      0
